# Zone voice & copy

Source of truth: **`lib/zone/zoneVoice.ts`** · quality gates **`lib/soloFocusCopy.ts`** · docs **`docs/ZONE-CONTENT-AND-DATA.md`** §7–10.

## Persona

**Forensic Mate / Warm Auditor** — trusted UK mate, data-honest, calm. One dry line of humour per card at most. Lowercase in body where natural; functional headlines uppercase.

## Hard rules

| Rule | Detail |
| --- | --- |
| **SAVE** | Imperative **SAVE** + CARBON on metrics — never "SAVINGS" as a label |
| **Numbers** | Only £ and kg CO₂e from Neon / `buildUserImpact` — never invent grants or totals |
| **Locality** | Town name in prose — never raw postcodes in user-facing copy |
| **Banned** | `FORENSIC_MATE_BANNED_PHRASES` in `zoneVoice.ts` and close paraphrases |
| **Verbs** | Prefer forensic verbs: slip, bleed, drain, overlook, reclaim — not "unlock", "optimise", "great news" |
| **Dev-speak** | Never: tile, lane, morph, scrape, pipeline, component, audit trail |
| **Structure** | No markdown, bullets, or What/Why/How labels in rendered prose |
| **Variety** | Do not repeat the same opening sentence, payoff, or headline fragment across cards in one session — `applySessionProseVariety` + `proofSentenceVariant` |
| **New card** | Yellow Marvin **+** on category label and nav destinations when `!isCardVisited(cardId)` — `lib/zone/soloFocusNewCard.ts` |

## Solo Focus nav rail (`SoloFocusJourneyNav`)

Wall order: **left = previous cell**, **right = next cell** (`advanceNavRingIndex` −1 / +1).

| Cell kind | Label | Helper |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Journey mother | UPPERCASE category | `formatSoloFocusNavMotherLabel` |
| Discovery / tip | lowercase title fragment (1–2 words) | `formatSoloFocusNavTipLabel` |

Tips must use **title vocabulary** (e.g. loft top-up, standing charge) — not the category singular echo (utility, grant) unless the title is empty.

## Surfaces

| Surface | Voice module |
| --- | --- |
| Bento + Solo Focus prose | `ZONE_WARM_AUDITOR_VOICE`, `resolveSoloFocusDisplayProse` |
| Content Architect batch | `ZONE_CONTENT_ARCHITECT_VOICE` |
| Zai chat | `ZAI_EDITORIAL_AUDITOR_DNA` — never scrape on chat turn |
| Nav rail | `SOLO_FOCUS_NAV_LABEL_VOICE` |

## Before shipping copy changes

1. Run `stripExpandedCardTitleNoise` on Solo Focus H1s.
2. Check category separation (home ≠ grants wording).
3. `npm run verify` after `app/` or `lib/` edits.
